          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo oyido iwodho go, Tamar odhiro wac ri ba cwore ni, “Won gigipiny me am'agamo gine iyan. Kaŋasa jo akinen ni apa ŋa, peta gi nyinge manitie i iye, thol kodi luth me.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.38.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.38.25"
            ]
